  "goodToKnow": "Die Vorgeschichte is the background or prior history of something: die Vorgeschichte des Streits, eine lange Vorgeschichte haben. In medicine, it's a patient's history: die Krankengeschichte or Anamnese. In archaeology, it's prehistory, the time before written records. A film's Vorgeschichte is its prequel story. From vor (before) and die Geschichte (history, story). Plural: die Vorgeschichten."
